      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So, apparently XPW Fanatic’s incap ability doesn’t care what zone OblivAeon is in, all damage will go there.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>this means that Mr. Fixers MKUS with dual crowbars hits for a lot. Rampage hits for a lot. So does AOE cards with Tachyon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fixed Point is a fun card, even more fun when you have OblivAeon in negative HP.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>my best game so far, and though I could have ended it sooner, or even later for more craziness, I decided to let hi, be his own undoing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://imgur.com/gallery/zJpwM9w\">https://imgur.com/gallery/zJpwM9w</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
